Opus and VP8 only, as the Linux and Windows library: the audio codec factories make Opus
alone (no G.711, G.722, iLBC, L16 or multichannel Opus), the default video codec
factories VP8 alone, and the framework holds no VideoToolbox H.264 encoder or decoder, no
VP9 and no AV1. No other codec can be negotiated, and none is there to decode what others
send.
